"LinkTarget":44,"Desc":12,"CustomizeLink":878,"UseLink":279,"Tooltip":879},"华硕增值服务","ASUS-Premium-Care","https://www.asus.com.cn/support/premium_care/","ASUS Premium Care",[],[],{"IsShowVolumePurchase":8,"VolumePurchaseText":302,"VolumePurchaseLink":507},{"Wording":12,"Icon":12,"hoverIcon":12,"Link":12},{"Name":885,"WebPath":886,"Link":12,"CustomizeLink":12,"LinkTarget":12,"AllProductFlag":24,"AllProductName":12,"AllProductLink":887,"PDLevel2":888},"显示器 / 台式机","Displays-Desktops","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/all-products/",[889,1003,1025,1064,1095,1156,1182,1269,1318,1352,1390,1417],{"Name":890,"WebPath":891,"Link":892,"CustomizeLink":892,"LinkTarget":12,"PDLevel3":893,"HotProducts":991,"VolumePurchase":1000,"ACCYFinder":1002},"显示器","Monitors","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/all-series/",{"SeriesName":269,"Series":894,"CategoryName":947,"Category":948},[895,896,901,906,911,917,923,929,935,941],{"Name":436,"WebPath":288,"Link":892,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":12,"CustomizeLink":892,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":12},{"Name":897,"WebPath":694,"Link":898,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":899,"CustomizeLink":898,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":900},"TUF GAMING 电竞特工","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/tuf-gaming/","TUF Gaming 电竞特工系列显示器适合预算有限的竞赛游戏玩家，它以诱人的价格提供精心挑选的高阶电竞功能组合。震撼的视觉效果现在触手可及。","顺畅的游戏过程",{"Name":902,"WebPath":721,"Link":903,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":904,"CustomizeLink":903,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":905},"ROG - 玩家国度系列","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/rog-republic-of-gamers/","玩家国度 (ROG) 在开发电竞屏幕方面已有超过十年的经验，为游戏玩家带来喜悦与激情。ROG Swift 系列是其中的巅峰之作，包含多项改变游戏规则的创新技术。","优越的游戏体验",{"Name":907,"WebPath":451,"Link":908,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":909,"CustomizeLink":908,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":910},"ProArt 专业系列","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/proart/","华硕 ProArt 专业显示器的目标是提供先进的技术，以激发创作者的想象力。ProArt 显示器具备 mini-LED 背光、OLED 显示器及 ASUS Smart HDR 技术，是创作杰出作品的理想伙伴。","准确色彩, 宽广色域",{"Name":912,"WebPath":913,"Link":914,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":915,"CustomizeLink":914,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":916},"游戏系列","Gaming","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/gaming/","华硕持续创新，从 2012 年推出 144Hz 消费性电竞显示器之后，仅仅两年就推出 1440p 分辨率的 Nvidia G-Sync 显示器。华硕预计在 2020 年将刷新率推升至 360Hz、4K HDR 搭配 144Hz，并推出120Hz 刷新率的 65 英寸大屏幕显示器。","出色的电竞品牌",{"Name":918,"WebPath":919,"Link":920,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":921,"CustomizeLink":920,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":922},"便携系列","ZenScreen","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/zenscreen/","ZenScreen 便携式屏幕的设计可让用户在外出时大幅提升生产力，并享受各种娱乐。它们具备小尺寸且多功能的特性，在任何地点都很容易设置，适用于各种使用环境。","便携, USB充电",{"Name":924,"WebPath":925,"Link":926,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":927,"CustomizeLink":926,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":928},"Eye Care 系列","Eye-Care","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/eye-care/","华硕护眼屏幕已获得多项 TÜV Rheinland 滤蓝光与不闪屏技术认证。华硕滤蓝光屏幕提供屏幕菜单，让您在屏幕上选择不同的蓝光过滤设置。华硕不闪屏技术利用智能动态背光调整以减少闪烁，以缓解眼睛疲劳。","滤蓝光 不闪屏",{"Name":930,"WebPath":931,"Link":932,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":933,"CustomizeLink":932,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":934},"触控系列","Touch","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/touch/","华硕触控显示器结合多点触控功能、优异的画质、丰富的连接功能，以及理想的人体工学设计。精密准确的多点触控屏幕具备多点同时触控能力，并针对 Windows 10 进行优化，让使用者以更具智能及效率的方式工作。","多点触控",{"Name":936,"WebPath":937,"Link":938,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":939,"CustomizeLink":938,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":940},"商用系列","Business","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/business/","华硕商用显示器内置摄像头、麦克风阵列及立体声扬声器，可用于视频会议及实时串流。显示器配备广视角 IPS 面板，可提供锐利的影像。人体工学设计可提供前后倾斜、垂直旋转、水平旋转及高低升降功能，让您以舒适的方式观看画面。","整合摄像头及麦克风",{"Name":942,"WebPath":943,"Link":944,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":945,"CustomizeLink":944,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":946},"医疗保健","Healthcare","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/healthcare/","医疗","面向医疗机构","按尺寸",[949,956,963,970,977,984],{"ID":950,"Name":951,"KeyName":952,"WebPath":952,"Link":953,"LinkTarget":12,"Icon":954,"hoverIcon":955,"SeriesPath":288,"Tooltip":12},51,"17.9英寸及以下","17-9-and-below","https://www.asus.com.cn/displays-desktops/monitors/all-series/filter?Category=17-9-and-below","https://www