rget":39,"Desc":1446,"CustomizeLink":1445,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1447},"https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/tuf-gaming/","TUF GAMING 电竞特工系列可发挥新一代 AMD 和 Intel® 平台重要组件的功能，并结合各种电竞功能与通过考验的耐用性。这些主板采用TUF级组件、怪兽级供电解决方案及全方位的散热选项，可提供坚如磐石的性能及出色的游戏稳定性。","坚固耐用",{"Name":1449,"WebPath":1450,"Link":1451,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1452,"CustomizeLink":1451,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1453},"大师系列","PRIME","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/prime/","ASUS PRIME 大师系列经过专业设计，可完全发挥 AMD 和 Intel 处理器的潜能。Prime 大师系列主板具备强大的供电设计、全面的散热解决方案和智能调校选项，以直观的软件和固件功能，为日常用户和 DIY 计算机组装玩家提供各种性能调校选项。","全方位装机",{"Name":1455,"WebPath":451,"Link":1456,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1457,"CustomizeLink":1456,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1458},"ProArt 创艺","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/proart/","ProArt 专业系列主板可消除各方面的障碍，为从事 3D 建模和渲染、动画或媒体制作的内容创作者提供更佳性能。此系列让您能专注于自己的创造力，拓展各种可能。","专业设计制图",{"Name":1460,"WebPath":1461,"Link":1462,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1463,"CustomizeLink":1462,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":450},"工作站主板","Workstation","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/workstation/","华硕工作站主板专为 AI 训练、深度学习、动画或 3D 渲染的专业人士而设计。华硕工作站主板配备可扩展的显卡与存储设备、出色的连接能力，以及更佳的可靠性，是创意专业人士和 IT 管理者的理想解决方案。",{"Name":1465,"WebPath":1466,"Link":1467,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1468,"CustomizeLink":1467,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1466},"行业专供板","CSM","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/csm/","华硕行业专供主板(CSM) 计划目的是为各种规模的企业提供稳定的主板，包括 36 个月供应、生命周期结束通知与 ECN 控制，以及 IT 管理软件 – ASUS Control Center Express 华硕远程控制中心。",{"Name":1470,"WebPath":937,"Link":1471,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1472,"CustomizeLink":1471,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1473},"商用主板","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/business/","华硕商用主板提供强化的功能，让 IT 作业更加流畅，包括全方位系统保护、全天候稳定性和可靠性，以及可简化自定义作业且经过改良的管理套件。","安全、稳定、可靠",{"Name":1475,"WebPath":1476,"Link":1477,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1478,"CustomizeLink":1477,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1479},"长征系列","Expedition","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/expedition/","华硕 Expedition长征系列主板专为不间断运行而设计，支持 Lightning Boot 闪电启动功能，可加快 BIOS 启动。 Expedition 长征系列主板经过精心设计，持久耐用，可防止受潮、腐蚀和过压损坏。它们经过严格的 144 小时无盘系统测试，并提供与热门游戏和 100 多种游戏外设的兼容性测试。Expedition长征系列主板提供震撼游戏音频以提升游戏沉浸体验，并提供更佳的稳定性、可靠性和性能表现。","适于 iCafe 网吧",{"Name":1481,"WebPath":1482,"Link":1483,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1484,"CustomizeLink":1483,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1485},"其它","Others","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/others/","华硕挖矿主板配备 19 个 PCI Express® (PCIe®) 插槽。B250 Mining Expert 内建 18 个 PCIe x1 与一个 PCIe x16 插槽，外加三个分区 ATX12V 电源接口，最多可平行执行 19 个 NVIDIA 或 AMD GPUs*，发挥更高的哈希率 (Megahash rate)！","其它主板",{"Name":1353,"WebPath":357,"Link":1487,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1488,"CustomizeLink":1487,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1489},"https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/accessories/","华硕提供不同种类的主板配件，包括 Thunderbolt™ 扩展卡、M.2 附加卡及风扇延伸卡，为组装工作站或电竞装备的 DIY 计算机用户提供更好的选择。","M.2 附加卡",[1491,1496],{"ID":1492,"Name":1331,"KeyName":1331,"WebPath":1331,"Link":1493,"LinkTarget":12,"Icon":1494,"hoverIcon":1495,"SeriesPath":288,"Tooltip":12},63,"https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/all-series/filter?Category=Intel","https://www.asus.com.cn/media/Odin/Websites/cn/ProductLine/20231012043835.svg","https://www.asus.com.cn/media/Odin/Websites/cn/ProductLine/20231012043840.svg",{"ID":1497,"Name":1337,"KeyName":1337,"WebPath":1337,"Link":1498,"LinkTarget":48,"Icon":1499,"hoverIcon":1500,"SeriesPath":288,"Tooltip":12},64,"https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/all-series/filter?Category=AMD","https://www.asus.com.cn/media/Odin/images/Category/icon_18_amd.svg","https://www.asus.com.cn/media/Odin/images/Category/icon_18_amd_a.svg",[1502,1506],{"ImageLink":1503,"Link":1504,"LinkTarget":12,"Title":1505,"NewsFlag":12},"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com.cn/gain/e00ca301-570a-4213-a787-64d3330906e2/w185","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/motherboards/tuf-gaming/tuf-gaming-x870-pro-wifi7-w-neo/","TUF GAMING X870-PRO 