"Desc":1535,"CustomizeLink":1534,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1536},"DUAL 系列","Dual","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/graphics-cards/dual/","ASUS Dual 系列运用源自旗舰显卡的先进散热技术，以纯粹的形式提供顺畅的游戏体验，是打造均衡计算机的理想选择。","双风扇 乐趣加倍",{"Name":1538,"WebPath":451,"Link":1539,"LinkTarget":12,"Desc":1540,"CustomizeLink":1539,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1541},"ProArt 创艺国度","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/graphics-cards/proart/","ProArt 创艺国度显卡将强大的散热性能与新的 GPU 架构相结合，使紧凑型主机和全尺寸工作站能够为创作者的工作流程提供强劲性能。","为创作者而生",{"Name":1543,"WebPath":1544,"Link":1545,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1546,"CustomizeLink":1545,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1547},"TURBO 系列","Turbo","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/graphics-cards/turbo/","ASUS Turbo 显卡是针对气流受限的系统而全新设计的产品。大量且细腻的优化可提升进气，让 80mm 的大型鼓风风扇可将更多空气吹向散热器并从机箱排出，为狭窄的区域带来更低的温度。","快速散热",{"Name":1549,"WebPath":1550,"Link":1551,"LinkTarget":39,"Desc":1552,"CustomizeLink":1551,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1553},"Phoenix 系列","Phoenix","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/graphics-cards/phoenix/","ASUS Phoenix 显卡将强大的性能尽可能纳入小型化设计中，可为小尺寸机箱提供广泛的兼容性。强大的单风扇解决方案符合其尺寸，并可充分运用您机箱的冷空气进气口。无论您是要升级老旧的显卡或组装电竞装备，Phoenix 都能提供新一代的强大性能。","强劲",{"Name":340,"WebPath":27,"Link":1555,"LinkTarget":12,"Desc":67,"CustomizeLink":1555,"UseLink":8,"Tooltip":1556},"https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/graphics-cards/asus/","坚固稳定",{"Name":1558,"WebPath":769,"Link":1559,"LinkTarget":44,"Desc":12,"CustomizeLink":1559,"UseLink":279,"Tooltip":1560},"GPU Tweak III","https://www.asus.com/campaign/GPU-Tweak-III","GPU Tunning Utility","按芯片类型",[1563,1566],{"ID":1564,"Name":1337,"KeyName":1337,"WebPath":1337,"Link":1565,"LinkTarget":48,"Icon":1499,"hoverIcon":1500,"SeriesPath":288,"Tooltip":12},68,"https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-components/graphics-cards/all-series/filter?Category=AMD",{"ID":1567,"Name":1568,"KeyName":1568,"WebPath":1568,"Link":1569,"LinkTarget":48,"Icon":1570,"hoverIcon":1571,"SeriesPath":288,"Tooltip":12},69,"NVIDIA","https://www.asus.com.cn/motherboards-co